{"agent": "r6", "predicted_confusion": ["T3-010", "T3-149"], "why": "Item 11 mixes border and move negotiations with peace treaties, making the line between settling space and ending a fight the hardest call in this batch."}
{"sub": "r/TheHulk", "theme_id": "T2-01554", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 1, "third_order": ["T3-123"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-123": "The concepts are demands and refusals about Hulk's spot, especially the flat refusal to relocate; this is refusing to give up space rather than fighting an attack under way or arguing first arrival."}, "confidence": "clear", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G12", "G13"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:00:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:00:10Z", "support": ["C0164450", "C1233441", "C0627538"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
{"sub": "r/TheHulk", "theme_id": "T2-44759", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 2, "third_order": ["T3-009"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-009": "The passages mark Hulk's relocation and survival as achieved, with pride and congratulations; they are not victory over a named rival or thanks to allies as the leading act."}, "confidence": "clear", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G21"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:01:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:01:10Z", "support": ["C0596072", "C0797415", "C1170330", "C0176175"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
{"sub": "r/FlipnoteStudio3D", "theme_id": "T2-62080", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 3, "third_order": ["T3-002"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-002": "The single concept is a call for the room's own people to help make the already named Frog at a set coordinate; that is calling hands to place rather than proposing a new mark or sharing a template."}, "confidence": "arguable", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G04", "G05"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:02:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:02:10Z", "support": ["C1460573"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
{"sub": "r/TheHulk", "theme_id": "T2-69582", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 4, "third_order": ["T3-188"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-188": "Croatian flag makers and other Croatians are repeatedly separated from the attackers, saying the rogues do not represent them; this is disowning placers outside the plan rather than merely tracing who changed pixels."}, "confidence": "clear", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G10"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:03:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:03:10Z", "support": ["C0195515", "C0126298", "C0562933", "C1300079"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
{"sub": "r/TheHulk", "theme_id": "T2-46203", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 5, "third_order": ["T3-142"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-142": "The insults and provocative joke target Croats as a people or nation, not just a rival sub, so they are ethnic mockery rather than ordinary community taunting."}, "confidence": "clear", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G18", "G19"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:04:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:04:10Z", "support": ["C1155012", "C0471081", "C0113316"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
{"sub": "r/TheHulk", "theme_id": "T2-64590", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 6, "third_order": ["T3-021"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-021": "Most concepts fix Hulk's changed or missing pixels and report improvement; apologies and attacker help are subordinate, so the leading act is watching and repairing the work."}, "confidence": "arguable", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G09", "G13", "G15"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:05:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:05:10Z", "support": ["C0940926", "C1272698", "C1522969", "C0511995"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
{"sub": "r/TheHulk", "theme_id": "T2-17196", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 7, "third_order": ["T3-043"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-043": "The thanks and credit go mostly to individual helpers and diplomats for the work; the single GreenLattice thank-you does not make allied-room thanks the leading act."}, "confidence": "clear", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G21"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:06:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:06:10Z", "support": ["C0257260", "C1443382", "C0221783", "C1149352"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
{"sub": "r/TheHulk", "theme_id": "T2-09882", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 8, "third_order": ["T3-087"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-087": "Members identify bots and individual placers changing Hulk and contest whether those changes are griefing; this is tracing who changed the work rather than only arguing the fairness of covering."}, "confidence": "arguable", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G10"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:07:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:07:10Z", "support": ["C1313254", "C0574530", "C0617302", "C0260467"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
{"sub": "r/TheHulk", "theme_id": "T2-22807", "batch": "B0017", "agent": "r6", "replicate": 1, "position": 9, "third_order": ["T3-002"], "multi": false, "why": {"T3-002": "The concepts are repeated calls to join, build, restore and keep Hulk alive; the dominant act is calling hands to place, not defending an attack as the leading frame or recruiting another sub."}, "confidence": "clear", "read": "whole", "exemplar_read": null, "families_opened": ["G04", "G14"], "bag": false, "t_start": "2026-05-03T12:08:00Z", "t": "2026-05-03T12:08:10Z", "support": ["C1196055", "C0966376", "C0257018", "C0626655", "C0541511"], "also_present": {}, "multiplacement_log": []}
